    "sentence_translations": [
      "Nine Roses",
      "",
      "Today is February 14. How many roses do you want to give to your girlfriend?",
      "You can give her eleven roses, nine roses, or nineteen roses.",
      "",
      "The word “one” means to tell her that you love only her and no one else. But one is too few, so you can give her eleven.",
      "",
      "In Chinese, the word “nine” sounds like “jiu” (久). “Jiu” (久) means a very long time.",
      "If you send her nine roses, it means that you will love her for a long time.",
      "If you think nine roses are too few, nineteen or twenty-nine roses are great."
    ]
